SUMMARY:Ragam Rasa: An Exclusive Four-Hands Dinner
LOCATION:Roso Restaurant
DESCRIPTION:On Thursday\, 8 October 2026\, Roso Restaurant at The Meru Sanu
 r and Bali Beach Hotel\, The Heritage Collection celebrates National Batik
  Day with “Ragam Rasa\,” an exclusive four-hands dinner exploring Indo
 nesia’s culinary heritage through a contemporary lens. From 6 PM to 9 PM
  \, the dinner brings together Celebrity Chef and Culinary Consultant Dega
 n Septoadji and Executive Sous Chef Prima Udayana of The Meru Sanur and Ba
 li Beach Hotel\, The Heritage Collection. Together\, they present a menu i
 nspired by the archipelago’s diverse culinary traditions as well as the 
 ingredients\, techniques and stories that shape them. The theme\, “ From
  Local Roots to Global Recognition “\, draws upon the story of batik its
 elf. Rooted in local craftsmanship\, traditions and cultural identity\, ba
 tik has developed into an internationally recognised art form. Ragam Rasa 
 explores a similar journey through food\, presenting Indonesian flavours a
 nd ingredients in a more modern expression while retaining their cultural 
 foundations.\n\nMore info: https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/ragam
 -rasa-an-exclusive-four-hands-dinner/\n\nPlease verify with the organizer 
 before attending.
URL:https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/ragam-rasa-an-exclusive-four-
 hands-dinner/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261008
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261009
END:VEVENT
